From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:47:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] backlight: apple_dwi: Wait for the previous command before
 sending
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bit 0 of the DWI channel control register stays set while a command is
being sent. iOS (AppleS8000DWI, _waitTransaction at 0xfffffff00634fbfc
and the 1 ms deadline at 0xfffffff00634fac8) polls it clear before every
command; the driver wrote the next command regardless, so a brightness
change following closely on another could be lost.

Poll the bit before writing a command, for up to 1 ms, and report a
channel that stays busy.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
[Orchard: from brkosebay/linux e846959b (J71t ledger 9.5); only the
 busy wait. Not carried: the lock (9.6, the backlight core serialises
 update_status) and the S8000 block initialisation at probe and resume
 (9.7, deferred to the suspend work).]
Co-developed-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Signed-off-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/video/backlight/apple_dwi_bl.c | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/video/backlight/apple_dwi_bl.c b/drivers/video/backlight/apple_dwi_bl.c
index 93bd74497..9900b592d 100644
--- a/drivers/video/backlight/apple_dwi_bl.c
+++ b/drivers/video/backlight/apple_dwi_bl.c
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
 #include <linux/bitfield.h>
 #include <linux/device.h>
 #include <linux/io.h>
+#include <linux/iopoll.h>
 #include <linux/module.h>
 #include <linux/platform_device.h>
 
@@ -33,6 +34,9 @@
 
 #define DWI_BL_MAX_BRIGHTNESS		2047
 
+/* A command takes well under a millisecond on the wire. */
+#define DWI_BL_SEND_TIMEOUT_US		1000
+
 struct apple_dwi_bl {
 	void __iomem *base;
 };
@@ -44,10 +48,21 @@ static int dwi_bl_update_status(struct backlight_device *bl)
 	int brightness = backlight_get_brightness(bl);
 
 	u32 cmd = 0;
+	u32 ctl;
+	int ret;
 
 	cmd |= FIELD_PREP(DWI_BL_CMD_DATA, brightness);
 	cmd |= FIELD_PREP(DWI_BL_CMD_TYPE, DWI_BL_CMD_TYPE_SET_BRIGHTNESS);
 
+	/* A command written while the previous one is still sent is lost. */
+	ret = readl_poll_timeout(dwi_bl->base + DWI_BL_CTL, ctl,
+				 !(ctl & DWI_BL_CTL_SEND1), 10,
+				 DWI_BL_SEND_TIMEOUT_US);
+	if (ret) {
+		dev_err(&bl->dev, "previous command still pending: %#x\n", ctl);
+		return ret;
+	}
+
 	writel(cmd, dwi_bl->base + DWI_BL_CMD);
 	writel(DWI_BL_CTL_SEND, dwi_bl->base + DWI_BL_CTL);
 
